# CloudFront is disabled until the AWS account is verified by AWS Support.
# To re-enable:
#   1. Delete or rename this file back to cloudfront.tf
#   2. Restore s3.tf to use OAC (private bucket + bucket policy with CloudFront principal)
#   3. Restore api_gateway.tf CORS to reference aws_cloudfront_distribution.frontend.domain_name
#   4. Restore outputs.tf cloudfront_distribution_id and cloudfront_domain outputs

